  caseIndex: 8
  caseSender: The 0R!9ln
  caseSubject: Already lost when you start
  caseBody: 'Evidence:

    Adrean... Oh, Adrean. I sea you. That pain nevr leves,
    doos it? The tramuh ov yor Farther at thee mine... the loss ov yor frend. So
    haevy. Yor wurk, yor aigncee... it''s all fer naught. It wuz utterly destroid
    yesteday, after wee were feree. Soo mutch strugl, soo mutch loss. Leve me tak
    that burdn from you. I will cume fer you. Luk outsyd. It iz only a shaddo, BUT
    IT IZ A WARNNING'
